#{\footnote # game_menu}${\footnote $ Game Menu Commands}K{\footnote K Game menu;Deal;Undo;Deck;Options;Exit}+{\footnote + commands:010}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 Game Menu Commands}\par
\pard\li120\tx2160\sa60 {\b Deal}\tab Starts a new game.\par
{\b Undo}\tab Undoes the last move.\par
{\b Deck}\tab Chooses the back of the cards.\par
{\b Options}\tab Chooses drawing one or three cards and the scoring.\par
{\b Exit}\tab Ends Solitaire.\par
