#{\footnote # playing_solitaire}${\footnote $ Playing Solitaire}K{\footnote K Playing Solitaire}+{\footnote + procedures:010}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 Playing Solitaire}\par
\pard\li120\sa120 Drag a card (or a pile) to a row stack where it goes on a card one higher of the other colour, or double-click it to send it to its suit stack. Click the deck to turn up cards. An empty row stack takes a king.\par
\page
